The generated package-lock.json file has no comment header. npm would reject
one. Its attribution is the author and copyright fields of package.json.

Third-party cryptography, used unmodified:
- ML-DSA-65: @noble/post-quantum (MIT), FIPS 204. This module does not
  reimplement the lattice signature.
- Ed25519: Node.js node:crypto, pure Ed25519 as specified by RFC 8032.
- Composite combiner: RFC 10073, id-MLDSA65-Ed25519-SHA512
  (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.6.48).

This module does not ship operational signing keys.
